{
"file": 22,
"paths": [
"d002/f623"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "be7be607",
"en_raw": "It's a suicide site, they say, Nao"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "6f908375",
"en_raw": "The pachinko parlor at the north exit"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "7d040ae3",
"en_raw": "You looked so happy"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "a54e70e0",
"en_raw": "and then a story like that..."
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "63f0fbd3",
"en_raw": "I see, no wonder"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "5dc5ec8d",
"en_raw": "it's always closed"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "fbc4bd30",
"en_raw": "I don't like it"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "1fa65a7a",
"en_raw": "What is?"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "3ae868d5",
"en_raw": "Sango is bound to say"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "2450b2a8",
"en_raw": "it"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "0e141c45",
"en_raw": "...Let's sneak in"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "adc4a94a",
"en_raw": "There's no way to get in"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "50df1f87",
"en_raw": "The shutter's down"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "45ce0050",
"en_raw": "Then maybe through the back door..."
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "f52df3a2",
"en_raw": "Anyway, I'm not going"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "141b5ad7",
"en_raw": "I see, the back door, huh..."
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "8935ce38",
"en_raw": "I never thought of that"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "7ad7168c",
"en_raw": "...Sango, are you listening?"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "36873306",
"en_raw": "We're not supposed to enter"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "2d9c78e9",
"en_raw": "pachinko parlors at all"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "085bf8c1",
"en_raw": "School rules ban arcades"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "396388d4",
"en_raw": "but they don't"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "a87d8b23",
"en_raw": "say pachinko parlors"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "51893211",
"en_raw": "are banned"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "fd458fe5",
"en_raw": "Well, leave it to me"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "8db040c7",
"en_raw": "The pachinko parlor's back door..."
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "e751e713",
"en_raw": "Down the side street of the redevelopment area"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "2825d9a5",
"en_raw": "near the parking lot, right?"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "31fcf493",
"en_raw": "Let's stop, Sango"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "381fd0a6",
"en_raw": "There's no way in"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "ffb90588",
"en_raw": "It's definitely locked"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "205036d5",
"en_raw": "We'll cross that bridge then"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "bcb3581b",
"en_raw": "Huh, someone was there"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "bf5945d0",
"en_raw": "And the sound of the ventilation fan"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "21dd2f4a",
"en_raw": "was really like a woman's voice..."
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "10d20f67",
"en_raw": "I don't really get it, but"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "27ec1f39",
"en_raw": "So was that person who seemed to be"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "d6bfb234",
"en_raw": "the manager the one who killed himself?"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "f604c7d3",
"en_raw": "What do you mean?"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "13dd526a",
"en_raw": "I mean, was the person Nao talked to"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "58076999",
"en_raw": "a ghost?"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "6b161339",
"en_raw": "How should I know"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "ef5c1d34",
"en_raw": "Hmm..."
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "f2f99377",
"en_raw": "Looks like I'll have to go myself"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "9fede0fa",
"en_raw": "I'm not going anymore"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "018ddc6b",
"en_raw": "The suicide wasn't the manager"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "c44b9344",
"en_raw": "but someone else, a woman...?"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "0c25f731",
"en_raw": "Hanging from the ceiling"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "91a32c8b",
"en_raw": "No matter how I think about it..."
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "1898934b",
"en_raw": "Still, we couldn't hear"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "6b9a4108",
"en_raw": "the important part"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "930197e8",
"en_raw": "And we can't go ask to use"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "637f1972",
"en_raw": "the bathroom again"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "c255ba4a",
"en_raw": "Hey, let's stop"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "ac0bdc8d",
"en_raw": "But Nao, that person"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "8343d8d8",
"en_raw": "isn't a ghost"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "565b93d1",
"en_raw": "How do you know that?"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "d743f689",
"en_raw": "How, well"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "60f4cf7c",
"en_raw": "you can normally tell"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "e08fa9b2",
"en_raw": "Because he's right there"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "a42cca82",
"en_raw": "Okay, this time let's go after"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "c1cf2f6e",
"en_raw": "the background of the incident"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "cda5e717",
"en_raw": "Take statements from everyone"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "b9f8e3a4",
"en_raw": "around here"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "98542d5d",
"en_raw": "And then, maybe..."
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "b7dd5d60",
"en_raw": "the police might know something"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "2746101e",
"en_raw": "Even the mom who killed herself..."
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "fdeef7f2",
"en_raw": "It's like a middle-aged ladies' magazine"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "339a603f",
"en_raw": "story, lacking credibility"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "fa8eca45",
"en_raw": "I get nauseous just hearing it"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "8545f31b",
"en_raw": "Info from the blond guy, let's see..."
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "f76a4f6a",
"en_raw": "What 'that matter'?"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "6025672d",
"en_raw": "He seemed like he knew"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "db76d4b7",
"en_raw": "quite a lot, though"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "1c1d2666",
"en_raw": "Doesn't look like we'll get more out of him"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "c05b06e2",
"en_raw": "Interview refused"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "aecbb7c0",
"en_raw": "That's awful, geez"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "007513eb",
"en_raw": "...Getting scolded is normal"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "6fa0b711",
"en_raw": "We can't keep up"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "d3195cdc",
"en_raw": "with Sango anymore"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "e919e458",
"en_raw": "Hey, Shiina, let's go to the wild plant garden"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "1bff2049",
"en_raw": "No, Kurumi will go"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "71afe2fe",
"en_raw": "with Sango"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "ded8df4b",
"en_raw": "What!?"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "b2a2aff0",
"en_raw": "Too bad!"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "f1a8483f",
"en_raw": "Shiina has been bribed"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "72e81a59",
"en_raw": "She got treated to ice cream"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "360fce06",
"en_raw": "We should ask people even closer"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "b34e37b6",
"en_raw": "to that pachinko parlor"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "47f873e4",
"en_raw": "After hanging from the ceiling"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "d3b03615",
"en_raw": "now it's stabbed with a knife..."
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "d28afa04",
"en_raw": "What he says is different every time"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "1fd7e3f1",
"en_raw": "How many women did that"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "6381de29",
"en_raw": "so-called manager kill, exactly?"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "f6e9c9dc",
"en_raw": "Hey, Sango, let's stop"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "e34014fa",
"en_raw": "Or else..."
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "344e5a97",
"en_raw": "he's just scaring us"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "c71c6579",
"en_raw": "or he's lost a screw..."
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "c7ecb6f3",
"en_raw": "Hey, that shop once more"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "f17e8c9d",
"en_raw": "when it gets around that time"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "c9fa116a",
"en_raw": "The blond guy, the aunties' stories"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "b3259ecf",
"en_raw": "and the police officer's attitude"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "4d006ea7",
"en_raw": "Put these together and..."
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "749debf6",
"en_raw": "it doesn't seem to be entirely that manager's"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "f89da9b3",
"en_raw": "delusion after all"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "ad167396",
"en_raw": "About the ghost...?"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "92d00545",
"en_raw": "No, that someone did commit suicide"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "ed0df12f",
"en_raw": "tied to that pachinko parlor"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "fb9522d8",
"en_raw": "This was a real incident"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "e5c99d3c",
"en_raw": "So are you satisfied now?"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "4222804d",
"en_raw": "Let's stop poking around"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "0b6fc9b7",
"en_raw": "But what does that manager"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "fb0299df",
"en_raw": "do every day, I wonder"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "eed1be83",
"en_raw": "Is he seriously going to open the shop..."
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "0ae936fe",
"en_raw": "I'm sure it will"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "5f66c82b",
"en_raw": "To a person like that, a word"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "8dd28aef",
"en_raw": "'Good luck'"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "341d9053",
"en_raw": "is it bad to go cheer him on?"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "f5b4a049",
"en_raw": "Do you mean that?"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "f2c330fe",
"en_raw": "Oh, that hurt..."
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "7790285a",
"en_raw": "I guess I don't have a shred"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "8a648751",
"en_raw": "of human feeling, whatever"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "ce4fafd9",
"en_raw": "I didn't say that"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "93ccbca1",
"en_raw": "...It can't be helped"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "4ee736e8",
"en_raw": "It's my parents' upbringing"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "f596e533",
"en_raw": "Fine, I'll go"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "0dcb7116",
"en_raw": "Then this time, let's go together"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "dec0231f",
"en_raw": "If I go alone, I get dragged"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "7e762789",
"en_raw": "into that manager's pace"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "69576f61",
"en_raw": "Good for him"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "ac116c85",
"en_raw": "He says he's opening tomorrow"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "4504defd",
"en_raw": "...Nao, are you"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "70a033a9",
"en_raw": "seriously thinking that?"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "bfa88dbe",
"en_raw": "He was a bit odd"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "f23ce4fa",
"en_raw": "but he was awfully serious"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "dbac0e78",
"en_raw": "That's not the issue"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "67873e2c",
"en_raw": "...A ghost parlor"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "6c9cd07a",
"en_raw": "is he opening a haunted house?"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "e8a248a2",
"en_raw": "So that's why he'll clean it up"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "3edb8868",
"en_raw": "tonight, surely"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "00561af9",
"en_raw": "As if that's possible..."
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "449adea0",
"en_raw": "Oh well"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "8c7881b6",
"en_raw": "We'll know tomorrow"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "7883ef84",
"en_raw": "...According to that weird manager"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "a853199f",
"en_raw": "today should be the so-called"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "970b2e2f",
"en_raw": "grand opening, right?"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "1b25dc3e",
"en_raw": "Hey, Sango, let's go see"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "9fcb0ebb",
"en_raw": "I plan to, but..."
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "08d2bdda",
"en_raw": "I somehow don't feel like it..."
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "c84b06e5",
"en_raw": "When will it open, I wonder"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "72161a7b",
"en_raw": "that pachinko parlor"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "a7c65b4f",
"en_raw": "It's never going to open"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "40d1f33e",
"en_raw": "So that person"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "1edb4eb1",
"en_raw": "was weird after all..."
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "e190823c",
"en_raw": "He must be up to something"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "2b31409b",
"en_raw": "Even if he talks tough"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "c4b011ba",
"en_raw": "he apparently did some"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "5f663ab3",
"en_raw": "pretty awful things"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "30ddbf63",
"en_raw": "That's the cause, isn't it?"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "89deb497",
"en_raw": "A pang of conscience?"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "c21366e7",
"en_raw": "Well, yeah"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "06f3ebb3",
"en_raw": "Which means after all..."
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "0de9e8bf",
"en_raw": "...a ghost's curse?"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "664a06bb",
"en_raw": "That's what people might say"
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "9391c2b4",
"en_raw": "But Sango, you don't believe"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "ad16462e",
"en_raw": "in ghosts, do you?"
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "6677278a",
"en_raw": "Yeah"
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "d4d5c536",
"en_raw": "Because they can't exist"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "20693b11",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Unopened Pachinko Parlor"
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "229aa650",
"en_raw": "A phantom created by weak hearts"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "85f0a582",
"en_raw": "That's what ghosts are"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "453ba901",
"en_raw": "Actually, I was a bit"
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "2403bf4a",
"en_raw": "scared too..."
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "56d15478",
"en_raw": "This is a secret, okay?"
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}